        "subject": "LU-20315 lnet: mark selftest init functions __init",
        "message": "LU-20315 lnet: mark selftest init functions __init\n\nsrpc_startup(), sfw_startup(), lstcon_console_init() and the helpers\nthey call for the RPC module, acceptor service and netlink family are\nonly reachable from lnet_selftest_init(), which is already __init.\n\nMark them __init too, along with the BUILD_BUG_ON wrapper in\nmodule.c, so the kernel frees them once module load completes\ninstead of keeping them resident for the life of the module.\n\nTest-Parameters: trivial\nSigned-off-by: Timothy Day <timday@thelustrecollective.com>\nChange-Id: I6d2c40a03dc824edb2499d7104c6744b6a6a6964\nReviewed-on: https://review.whamcloud.com/c/fs/lustre-release/+/69494\nReviewed-by: James Simmons <jsimmons@infradead.org>\nTested-by: jenkins <devops@whamcloud.com>\nTested-by: Maloo <maloo@whamcloud.com>\nReviewed-by: Arshad Hussain <arshad.hussain@aeoncomputing.com>\nReviewed-by: Oleg Drokin <green@whamcloud.com>\n"
      },
      "branch": "refs/heads/master"
